  turkishPath: "/2026/08/kapidaki-bevvabdan-ozel-guvenlige-okul-guvenligi-tarihi.html",
  title: "From Ottoman School Watchmen to Metal Detectors: A Long History of School Security",
  description: "Hiring security guards for Turkish schools has a long history. From Ottoman bevvâbs to Law 5188 and CCTV, we trace how school security has evolved.",
